{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Creator: Immerse Yourself in the World of Design<br>The Creator is a simulation game where you become a design master, creating stylish and cozy spaces in the most picturesque corners of the world. No limits, no stress \u2014 just creativity and inspiration! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.poster.avif?t=1758954130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.webm?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.mp4?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Design Master<br>Use a variety of decor elements, furniture, plants, and landscape features to create unique interior and exterior designs. <br>Choose styles, colors, and materials to your liking, filling locations with an atmosphere of comfort and harmony. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.poster.avif?t=1758954130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.webm?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.mp4?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Location Variety</strong><br>Customize cozy city apartments and residential homes of all kinds. <br>Garages and various rooms offer space for your unique ideas. <br>Enhance the setting with comfortable rest areas and functional elements. <br>Thousands of items await to be part of your design projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/62db8556cc59ec13c4afe8eebb5b3d79.poster.avif?t=1758954130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/62db8556cc59ec13c4afe8eebb5b3d79.webm?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/62db8556cc59ec13c4afe8eebb5b3d79.mp4?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Creativity and Immersion</strong><br>Forget about resource hunting and constraints \u2014 focus entirely on beauty creation. <br>Experiment freely, enjoying the process and finding perfect solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/b3c5fe6518dd4fbacad3a1fb3d922110.poster.avif?t=1758954130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/b3c5fe6518dd4fbacad3a1fb3d922110.webm?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic day-night cycles and diverse weather conditions \u2014 from sunny days to thunderstorms with lightning \u2014 add depth and expressiveness to your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/52acd0ea946a1aa47d419f03b04c26b3.poster.avif?t=1758954130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/52acd0ea946a1aa47d419f03b04c26b3.webm?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/52acd0ea946a1aa47d419f03b04c26b3.mp4?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Capture stunning photos of your projects with a customizable photo mode featuring various filters.<br>Share your best shots with friends and the gaming community, drawing inspiration from others\u2019 work. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1940870?t=1758954130","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/b55f7c01d05dc74fa3b37d7358594e34cae8e8a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758954130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/db91d54a25d2107209add9f1e86109e7c3253ec7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758954130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/db91d54a25d2107209add9f1e86109e7c3253ec7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758954130","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3757250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Creator: Immerse Yourself in the World of Design<br>The Creator is a simulation game where you become a design master, creating stylish and cozy spaces in the most picturesque corners of the world. No limits, no stress \u2014 just creativity and inspiration! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.poster.avif?t=1758954130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.webm?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/8f3212c714c17512750bcab72799fd00.mp4?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Design Master<br>Use a variety of decor elements, furniture, plants, and landscape features to create unique interior and exterior designs. <br>Choose styles, colors, and materials to your liking, filling locations with an atmosphere of comfort and harmony. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.poster.avif?t=1758954130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.webm?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/a04e0547afd7b9c35a2fc55cc3ee41d2.mp4?t=1758954130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Location Variety</strong><br>Customize cozy city apartments and residential homes of all kinds. <br>Garages and various rooms offer space for your unique ideas. <br>Enhance the setting with comfortable rest areas and functional elements. <br>Thousands of items await to be part of your design projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\